                        <li class="mb-2">Web Beacons, also known as pixel tags or clear GIFs, are used to count and recognize users to a website, or demonstrate that a webpage or email was accessed or opened, or that certain content within it was viewed or clicked, typically to compile statistics about usage of websites and the success of marketing campaigns.</li>
